WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:28.900
I'm a robot, I'm a machine, but I'm a wind.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.790
I'll be right-

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.070
I'll be right-o-

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:51.990
I'll be right-o-re-

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.250
Both of them are useless shoguns.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:30.640
Who do you think you are?

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:55.550
Mercury, the Prime Minister, what do you think of this battle rifle?

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.550
Idiot, don't joke around!

00:01:58.910 --> 00:01:59.860
This is...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.800
I can see that you're eager to fight when you see a lump of steel.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.620
All right, I got it.

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:05.470
It's a strategy from Nongaki.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.470
The Kuhaku Fortress Research Institute is still being repaired.

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:10.470
Finish it off!

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:13.220
Yes, sir! I'll finish it off.

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.460
Hercules, show them what you've got.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:24.190
Rescue the research institute before it's too late!

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.630
I'm here.

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:37.070
This is my research research center.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.430
I like it.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:39.850
It's like a blue one.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.840
I'm done.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.500
But it's already finished.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.500
But it's great.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:48.980
Let's go.

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:26.980
We just got back from the war and now we're just friends.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.430
If it were here, we'd always be together.

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.920
Damn it. If I had gone one step faster, I would have saved the professor.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:52.380
I will never make such a sacrifice again, so please forgive me, Professor Tonda.

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:56.190
Tetsuya! There is a strange storm in the East China Sea,

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.140
and it is rising to the north of the Pacific Ocean at a speed of 90 kilometers per hour.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:00.180
That's right.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.880
What? A typhoon?

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.420
It's strange. It's different from the typhoon season.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.020
The research institute is still in process after being attacked by the Dark Grand Shogun.

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:14.370
If the typhoon is caused by the Dark Grand Shogun...

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:16.980
All right, I'll report it to the doctor.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:18.580
Haruna, come here.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.410
All right, I'll go investigate.

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:25.720
Tetsuya, if this is caused by the Dark Grand Shogun,

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.760
he might be plotting something.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.720
Let's take a closer look.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.080
That's better.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.230
All right, we have to hurry and let the boss know!

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:45.800
Hurry up! If something happens, the typhoon will come our way!

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.690
What typhoon? Don't give me that stupid information!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:50.180
We know how to remodel the boss blot,

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.620
so that we can reward Professor Tonda for his hard work!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.680
The Great Majinger isn't here yet?

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.220
No, it hasn't come out yet.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.220
Damn it!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.600
We have to lure the Majinger out of here.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.540
We have to attack the science fortress research center.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.840
What are you going to do, General Ulyssesar?

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.000
All right, let's dive into the ocean.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.660
We'll cause a tsunami from the bottom of the ocean.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:30.900
What?

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:33.100
The typhoon suddenly disappeared into the sea?

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:35.100
Let's go.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.810
It's clear that General Ankokda is behind this.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:35.110
I don't think it's a big wave in the research field.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:36.460
It's strange.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.100
It's a big wave.

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.140
Tetsuya, it's gone.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.730
Let's check the tsunami.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:44.270
Yes.

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:05.000
I won't lose to you

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.520
Because I'm a robot

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:08.980
I'll run

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:09.760
Start the engine!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:14.600
Be careful, Tegiag!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.710
Condor, ready for launch!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.190
Roger that. Let's go!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.210
Roger that! Brain Condor, switch on!

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.370
Boss, we have to let them know. Boss, we're going to Majin Gama.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:55.490
What are you going to do? Boss, what are you going to do?

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.930
I got it. It's all done.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:58.930
But where did this water come from?

00:07:58.990 --> 00:07:59.450
Where is the North Pole?

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.740
What are you doing? Get out of the way!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.400
Oh, it's around there.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:37.940
Huh? What's that sound?

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:45.250
You've put in the effort, but you're finally here.

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:47.760
All right, let's head to the deep sea!

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:48.700
Yes, sir!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.410
All right, stop spinning and throw the Mazinger into the sea.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:08.010
Leave the rest to Hercules.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:09.970
We'll go destroy the research facility.

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:33.270
Huh!?

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:34.620
Thank you for watching!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:47.490
Let's go.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:48.510
I'm sure of it.

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.350
This giant flying object is...

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:51.130
It's that Mikuros!

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:52.040
Hmm...

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:52.970
All right.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:53.640
Let's get into combat.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:54.680
Yes, sir!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.550
I thought the war was over, but something even worse came out.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:09:59.270
It's scary.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.800
Don't worry. I'll be with you.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:10.420
Tetsuya! Tetsuya! Tetsuya!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.880
Strange. There's no response.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:16.530
All right. Jun, let's go.

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:17.280
Forget about Tetsuya.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.460
Jun, protect the lab.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:23.240
Tetsuya! Tetsuya!

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:26.240
Tetsuya, respond!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.160
Okay!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:31.490
Thank you.

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:29.430
I'm afraid it's going to be a tsunami.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.940
I'll destroy the research center!

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:04.590
I'm here! Let me go!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.600
Prepare yourself, Thabtokens!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.140
Our Great Mazinger is supposed to have been slaughtered by Hercules!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:37.360
I won't tell you to come out!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.060
I'll have you ambushed in the lab and killed!

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:51.940
Tetsuya, where are you?

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:56.470
What should we do, Marcel?

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:59.420
If we stay here, the foundation will collapse and the lab will be destroyed!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:05.130
If we sink into the sea, the waves will be less resistant.

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.930
But the repairs are not complete yet.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:09.710
What is Jun doing?

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.470
W-W-What should I do?

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:35.150
What should you do?

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.530
What are you going to do? Are you going to get scared now, boss?

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:40.980
All right! I'll show you the power of a new weapon!

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:47.820
Huh?!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.160
Let's go!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:50.920
Get out of here!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:05.240
Thank you.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:35.880
Boss, you really scared me.

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.840
This time, I'll go from here!

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:39.120
Label missile!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:57.280
All right, I'll finish you off!

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.600
Tetsuya! Tetsuya!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:14:59.520
The lab is in danger!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.700
Then give it back to me!

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:03.500
Damn it! You always take one step at a time!

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:19.500
I didn't modify the vault to do that!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:21.060
Boss!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:22.360
Nuri!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:30.150
What?

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:34.640
It's hot!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.050
Tetsuya, hurry up!

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:50.010
Kabuto Kenzo, the lab will be destroyed soon!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:56.300
The lab will be destroyed soon. Let's see what happens.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:02.140
That's it! Look at that, Mikelos!

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:03.380
I'll show you how scary this Majinger is!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:04.580
There!

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:14.450
This is where Mikelos' weakness lies!

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.060
I'll attack from here!

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.400
Let's go, Mikelos!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:25.130
What's going on?

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:27.310
It looks like something hit Skrull!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:27.910
Huh?

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:28.610
It's a Majinger!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:29.930
A Great Majinger!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:30.780
The Great Majinger is attacking the screw part.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.370
What? What did you say? What happened to Hercules?

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:38.300
I don't know. There's only one Great Majinger.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:41.100
All right, let's start the battle!

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:52.700
Stop the attack!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.900
Use Marine Attack to destroy the Majinger!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:07.480
Huh? The rotation has stopped!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:09.860
Alright! Marine Attackers, go out!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:27.240
Oh, there's a lot of them.

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:33.520
All right! Breast Burn!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.400
Hey, the waves have calmed down!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:50.790
It's true! It's calmer now!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.350
I'm saved!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:58.160
I was saved in one shot!

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.460
Please calm down!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.800
The Majingan is in danger!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:13.220
Yunus! Yunus!

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.040
Mika!

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:16.380
Here, Jun!

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.620
The Majingan is in danger! Go and help!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:22.440
I'm going!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:23.810
Okay!

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:26.010
Now, it's finally time for the real show!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:56.300
We'll leave the rest to the Marine Attackers and attack the research facility.

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.940
The research facility is far away from here.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.320
I'm sure they're waiting for us. Let's crush them at once!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.120
Attack at full speed!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:06.630
S-Sherlock, the Spirits have been defeated by the Majingers.

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:08.860
We can't move forward. We can't speed up.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:11.150
What? Damn it!

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:12.210
You're saying we're all in for a fight!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.370
I don't care!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.530
Oh no! Mikeros is running away!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:27.410
Damn! The research facility is in danger!

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.490
It's Mikelos. What's wrong with Magigar?

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.920
Hurry up, boss!

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:34.560
Okay!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.130
Wait a minute!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:06.240
Thank you, June! You saved me!

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.600
I'm going after Mikelos!

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:08.660
I'll leave the rest to you!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.740
Okay! Leave the rest to me!

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:13.780
What?!

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.360
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.200
Look! The Science Fountain Research Institute!

00:20:34.260 --> 00:20:34.960
It's tilting!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.800
General, it's the Mazinger! It's coming!

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.760
What? It's coming?

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:40.840
What a persistent guy!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:48.130
Are you ready?

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:49.760
Let's go, Mykeros!

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:01.590
What are you going to do?

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.090
I'm going to kill you!

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:13.940
What are you going to do?

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:15.020
I'm going to kill you!

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:15.280
What?

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:23.540
Aren't you both going to die?

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:26.280
You're a lucky guy, Mikeros.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:27.500
I'm going to bury you next time.

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:07.680
Boss, we're in danger!

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:20.660
Why did you run away, Caesar?

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:24.800
Why did you rush into the research facility and kill yourself?

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:29.060
But, General Angok, the research facility is...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.000
I'm sure it was a good strategy, but I don't think it was a good one.

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:34.890
You idiot!

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:37.540
If you think it was a good strategy, then you should have ended it!

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:40.400
If you were going to hurt Mikelos so badly,

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:43.690
you should have let him fall from the sky and made him a fool!

00:22:45.950 --> 00:22:50.200
All right, get ready for the next mission!

00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:51.980
Yes, sir!

00:22:52.660 --> 00:22:58.160
Yes, sir!

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:11.920
Thank you, Tetsuya, Jun, and the others.

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:51.520
Ta-a-a-a-a-a-a-a-m

00:24:30.640 --> 00:24:38.240
General Doraido sent Gomodra, a reptile-type fighter, to defeat Great Maginger.

00:24:38.280 --> 00:24:40.890
At that time, the citizens were terrified by the army of spiders.

00:24:42.470 --> 00:24:46.790
Tetsuya also stood up to fight against Gomodra, suffering from the poison of spiders.

00:24:48.150 --> 00:24:50.200
Gomodra blows up the frozen liquid without hesitation.

00:24:50.740 --> 00:24:51.900
Do your best, Tetsuya!

00:24:52.040 --> 00:24:53.740
Next time on Great Maginger,

00:24:53.900 --> 00:24:56.010
Please look forward to the horror of the spider hell!
